Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Twixie Superstars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yimou...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Buenas, pequeñas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,구 Thanks to Famas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yimou...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before I take your two\Nlocator cards straight to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are pretty big words coming from\Na guy with no monsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I can hit you where it\Nreally counts, your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.33,0:01:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,remember I've covered the playing field\Nwith ocean water, giving me the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think Joey Wheel is\Nafraid of a few drops of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,guess again, you big sardine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.27,0:01:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hold on to your\Nswim trunks while I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.95,0:01:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This little number's exactly what\NI need to harpoon this whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Mako, brace yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm about to fight a serious\Nchunk out of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try, landlubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I summoned Baby Dragon in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest getting a\Nlife preserver for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He may not be strong now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll use polymerization to\Nfuse my two monsters together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.79,0:02:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hi to Alligators Sword Dragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City rules state fusion monsters\Nmust wait one turn before attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, Aqua Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I plan to\Nsink you in my next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can wait? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako waits for nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the tide shall turn as I summon\Na monster and hide it in the deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your underwater monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My beast will show itself when\Nthe time arrives Joey's chum if he
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't find out what's lurking\Nbeneath those waves I know Mako's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,sea monster could be anything I\Ndon't even know if it's an attack
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,or defense mode Fear what you\Ncannot see The ocean hides all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,well if your little chicken at a\Nsea is gonna hide Then I guess my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,alligator sword dragon will just have\Nto fly over it So take off, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:03:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for my dragon to take a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,little nosedive right\Ninto your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.81,0:03:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the greatest ocean duelist\Nin the seven seas is all washed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,we're almost home dad there's\Na storm ahead look out dad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,there's one thing i've learned about\Nthe sea don't underestimate its strength
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and now i'll place a card\Nface down deep below the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,surface and i guess it's time to\Nfinish you off Nice try, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like I'll be going to the\Nfinals with your two locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.91,0:03:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey wins if this attack works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.57,0:03:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's cross our fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator's sword dragon, wipe\Nout the rest of his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.29,0:04:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that won't work twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I activate tornado walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean's power will\Ndefend my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.11,0:04:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,my trap card has created a\Ntyphoon forming giant pillars
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.21,0:04:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,of water that will block\Nevery one of your attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.31,0:04:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako's tropical storm is using all\Nthe power of the ocean against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'm standing on dry land now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but what happens if he\Nreleases his tornadoes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.53,0:04:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and floods the entire playing field again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My strategy sunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Never underestimate the\Npower of the mighty sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.39,0:04:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Skipper, call off the\Nstorm and release your tornadoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, bring on the flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, the ocean's water still\Nconceals one of my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I sacrifice my hidden beast\Nto summon an even greater one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's an even stronger\Nmonster lurker down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to fight\Nsomething I can't even see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to get your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to meet my rarest monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when you thought it was\Nsafe to go back in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Sea Stealth 2, the\Nlegendary fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll weaken him with Energy Drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows my dragon to blast your\Nmonster's attack points down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with the mighty sea on my side
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragon! But he was supposed to\Nzap your monster. What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.09,0:05:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple As long as the sea\Ncovers the playing field My
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.63,0:05:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,legendary fisherman is protected\Nfrom all magic cards No, it can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster is a long time\Nfriend of the sea And the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,very waters in which it\Nlives shield it from harm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place my own mystery monster in\Ndefense mode to keep you guessing, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary fisherman, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he heard you down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A good fisherman takes his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My tiny guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is Snapperhead gonna hide\Nlike a frightened shrimp?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My fisherman is brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.53,0:06:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He has more nerve than the mighty whale,\Nmore strength than the great white shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it kind of looks like you, only\Na little older and a little creepier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, that card represents my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,a courageous fisherman who\Nloves the sea as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:07:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The very sea that took him\Nfrom me when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be safe here, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean can be a violent\Nand unpredictable force,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as a calm and tranquil one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm passed as quickly as it\Narrived, but my father was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed the lifeboat was missing from\Nour ship, So I knew my father escaped,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and I waited day after\Nday for him to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I even built a monument overlooking\Nthe sea to guide him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Years passed, but still I waited, watching\Nthe waves for any glimpse of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.49,0:07:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He taught me never to give up, no\Nmatter how hopeless the situation seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain or shine, I kept watch, knowing\Nhe had to be out there somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and that one day, the sea\Nwould bring him home to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And then it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Special overseas delivery for Mr. Tsunami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:08:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a package containing a Duel Monsters\Ncard and an anonymous note that read,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.85,0:08:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The card in the package was Sea Stealth 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,a legendary fisherman just like my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.71,0:08:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I battle every duel\Nin the name of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking of his bravery gives\Nme strength and determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And my Legendary Fisherman card\Nreminds me never to give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how hard the struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can promise all of you by the\Nseven seas, I will not lose this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My Legendary Fisherman will\Ntake me straight to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's get back to\Nthis duel so I can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a lot of respect for you, Mako,\Nbut I'm the one going to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna fillet all\Nyour fish to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go ahead and make\Nyour move, little minnow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll summon a\Nmonster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My ocean assault shall continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For this next monster can't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.87,0:09:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My Fortress Whale's Oath card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use this magic card\Nand sacrifice two monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can bring forth this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise, my fortress whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The most powerful creature in my deck,\Ncapable of crushing you with a single swipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I need to do for you in order\Nto receive the Millennium Items, Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, first, answer me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How strong are your dueling skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:09:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're extremely strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know I've dueled in several\Nshadow games throughout history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised? I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.91,0:10:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've returned for the sole\Npurpose of obtaining the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,seven millennium items and\Nthe power they possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll ask you once again,\Nwhat do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need you\Nto duel on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll deliver the items to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll duel whomever you want me to, provided\NI receive my payment once I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just what is it you expect to gain from\Nthis battle I duel for you, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.65,0:10:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a collector like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Win me the cards I want,\Nand the items are yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.05,0:10:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a whale of a\Nmonster right there, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And the ocean field gives\Nit even more attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I may be in over my head here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I must agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, I'm going to\Ndestroy your defense monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary Fisherman, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you have no\Nmonsters on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortress Whale, attack\Nhis life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,His life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel isn't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one step away from\Nthe Battle City finals, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your light points are almost depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack and you're sunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.19,0:11:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm gonna get out of this mess, I\Ngotta summon a monster and attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But his whale's too powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and in order to attack his\Nfisherman, I'd have to find it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still time to\Nturn this duel around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just believe in yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,See those two shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them has got to be the fisherman\Nthat may go hid under the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can end this duel\Nwith my fortress whale
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,above and my legendary\Nfisherman hidden below.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The aquariums kill a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.53,0:12:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,then the other Shadow Underwater\Nmust be Mako's legendary fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I just need the right\Ncard so I can destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I got two magic cards, one\Nmonster card, and one trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.55,0:12:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus one card face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not going to be easy, but I think\NI know how to destroy both his monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place two cards\Nface down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll summon my panther\Nwarrior in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Since panther warrior needs a sacrifice\Nin order to attack, I gotta end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, crab cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as my fortress whale attacks,\Nyour life points will go down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be capsized\Nby my almighty behemoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to say goodbye to your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, my whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a plan to turn both\Nyour monsters into fish
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticks. So I'll activate my\Ntrap card now. Magic Arm Shield
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Attach the banter warrior\NAnd now it's time to go
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.19,0:13:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,fishing And I know just where\Nto find the catch in a day
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to reel him in and use\Nhim as a shield against your attack No,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.47,0:13:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,my legendary fisherman
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to destroy him. Because\Nyour whale's about to do that for me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed my own legendary fisherman\NThe most prized card in my entire
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.97,0:14:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,dueling deck How could I be so careless\Nto let something like this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's just a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than just a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I need my legendary fisherman in\Norder to be brave. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of the bravest guys I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta give yourself a lot\Nmore credit than that, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that card reminds me of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And what a courageous man he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.69,0:14:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I crushed my inspiration. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already got what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been inside you this whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.59,0:14:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and you don't need a card\Nwith a picture of some freaky
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-looking fisherman sitting\Non a shark to inspire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.87,0:14:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off! Look, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm trying to say is that you can be\Ninspired by your father without that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something inside\Nevery duelist that drives him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.41,0:14:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you know, Joey? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I duel for my\Nlittle sister, Serenity,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,just the same way that\Nyou duel for your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.05,0:15:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And she inspires me even when\Nshe's not right next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't be so hard on yourself for\Ndestroying your legendary fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memories of your dad and your courage\Nare in your heart, not in that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And nothing can take that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.99,0:15:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's get back to this duel already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.59,0:15:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it's my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortress Whale, take out his\NPanther Warrior for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to stop you, Because\NI activate Kunai with Chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This card stops your\Nwhale from attacking and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,raises my Panther Warrior's\Nattack points by 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid my whale is still stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And your point is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Panther Warrior, attack his whale now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you that my\NFortress Whale has more attack
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.03,0:16:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,points than your Panther Warrior\Neven with its power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm afraid your\Nmonster's been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true my Panther Warrior's attack\Npoints are slightly lower than your Whale's,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're forgetting one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This little face-down card over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got just the power\Nboost that my monster needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.07,0:16:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Blade's Electrical Jolt raises\Nmy Panther's attack points by 800,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,which means your whale's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And there go most of your light coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, six.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll play this, Return of the Doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.75,0:16:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings back one of my monsters\Nand hides it under water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,One of Mako's monsters is back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.15,0:16:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:16:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant True Name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This card sends all magic and trap cards
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,back to the player's\Nhands and off the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.43,0:17:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So I could use it to dry\Nup Mako's ocean and expose
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever monster he brought\Nback from his graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if my Panther Warrior can't\Ndefeat whatever's hiding down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and make your move so my Creature\Nof the Deep can strike and end this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,when Mako covered the field in ocean water,\Nit gave his sea monsters a power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I dry things up, it'll lower\Nhis hidden monster's attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Giant True Name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Drain the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You've exposed my fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.35,0:17:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been an honor to duel you, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:17:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I sacrifice one of them so\Nmy Panther Warrior can attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never give up, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right, Mako?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was an excellent duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.81,0:18:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are my two rarest cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And two locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.75,0:18:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to give\Nme your fisherman card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You earned these cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a card to remember my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,His courage and support are\Nalways with me inside my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll treat it with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And best of luck in the finals. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right, Nico.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, Joey Wheeler's dual\Ndeck was traced to Sector 075.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Our satellite tracking system\Nfound your friends, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you exactly\Nwhat you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if you agree to duel me as\Nsoon as we find them. That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a game, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are in jeopardy\Nand they need my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A madman is after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I already accepted your\Nchallenge, so you will get your duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I know my\Nfriends are safe from harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's the case, then I think\Nyou had better follow me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that we're not too late.
